From 0487ef31bc6dc1d0468f2da3d2b13e1faa490a27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kenan <kenankzmv@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 29 Jun 2025 22:10:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat: enhance image generation with logo mockup support
 and update ESLint rules

- Added support for generating logo mockups in the image editor, returning predefined product images when relevant keywords are detected.
- Updated ESLint configuration to include additional rules for React and Tailwind CSS.
- Increased file size limit for uploads from 5MB to 15MB and expanded accepted image types.
- Improved user feedback in the image editor during the generation process.
